---
pagination:
  data: site.categories
  size: 1
  alias: desk
  addAllPagesToCollections: true
permalink: "{{ desk.path }}"
layout: layouts/section.njk
---
{% if desk.slug == "nhl-starting-goalies" and nhlTonight.isCurrent %}
{% set currentHeading = "Tonight's starters" %}
{% include "partials/tonight-board.njk" %}
{% elif desk.slug == "nhl-starting-goalies" %}
<p class="board-stale-notice"><strong>Awaiting today's update.</strong> The board below the latest stories is previous-day information for {{ nhlTonight.night.label }}, not tonight's games. <a href="{{ ('/nhl/starting-goalies/' ~ nhlTonight.night.date ~ '/') | url }}">Dated archive for {{ nhlTonight.night.label }}</a>.</p>
{% elif not desk.inSeason %}
<p>This section is between seasons ({{ desk.season }}). Coverage resumes with spring training and Opening Day news.</p>
{% else %}
<p>This hub is launching. In-season news, injuries and lineup changes will appear here, each with its source.</p>
{% endif %}
{% if desk.slug == "nhl-starting-goalies" %}
<h2>Goalie news</h2>
{% endif %}
{% set stories = collections.posts | whereCategory(desk.name) %}
{% set emptyNote = "No story has been published in " ~ desk.name ~ " yet." %}
{% include "partials/story-list.njk" %}
{% if desk.slug == "nhl-starting-goalies" %}
{% if not nhlTonight.isCurrent %}
<h2>Previous board</h2>
{% set currentHeading = "Tonight's starters" %}
{% include "partials/tonight-board.njk" %}
{% endif %}
<h2>Daily archive</h2>
<ul>{% for n in nhlNights %}<li><a href="{{ ('/nhl/starting-goalies/' ~ n.date ~ '/') | url }}">{{ n.label }}</a></li>{% endfor %}</ul>
<h2>Starting goalie history</h2>
<p>Confirmed starters from these nights, limited to rows with an NHL.com or club source, are in the <a href="{{ '/nhl/starting-goalies/history/' | url }}">starting goalie history file</a>. The <a href="{{ '/nhl/starting-goalies/history.csv' | url }}">CSV</a> is the same file. Save totals stay on the linked source.</p>
{% endif %}
